        "notes": "\"Abyssal Swarm\" is a top-down shooting game. Players will pilot mechs and battle mutated creatures in the post nuclear apocalypse world. In the game, players will use various weapons (cannons, flamethrowers, howitzers, etc.), drive various vehicles and mechs, and eliminate various mutant creatures. During this process, there will be bloody and dismembered scenes. In some levels, the scene may also be filled with bloodstains and limbs."
